#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:16
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "General"
msgstr "Bendra"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:21
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Configure the EU-compliant order withdrawal button (Directive (EU) "
"2023/2673). Customers use the withdrawal form page to withdraw from a "
"contract; requests appear under the Requests tab."
msgstr ""
"Sukonfigūruokite ES reikalavimus atitinkantį užsakymo atsisakymo mygtuką "
"(Direktyva (ES) 2023/2673). Klientai naudoja atsisakymo formos puslapį, kad "
"atsisakytų sutarties; prašymai rodomi skirtuke „Prašymai“."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:41
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal page"
msgstr "Atsisakymo puslapis"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:45
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "This page should contain your withdrawal form shortcode."
msgstr "Šiame puslapyje turėtų būti jūsų atsisakymo formos trumpasis kodas."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:56
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Embed in footer"
msgstr "Įterpti poraštėje"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:57
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Embed the withdrawal button directly in the footer. Disable this option if "
"you plan to embed the page manually."
msgstr ""
"Įterpti atsisakymo mygtuką tiesiai į poraštę. Išjunkite šią parinktį, jei "
"ketinate įterpti puslapį rankiniu būdu."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:65
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display everywhere"
msgstr "Rodyti visur"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:66
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display the button on every page, not just on shop-related pages."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti mygtuką kiekviename puslapyje, ne tik su parduotuve susijusiuose "
"puslapiuose."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:77
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Mygtuko tekstas"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:78
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Text of the withdrawal button in the footer and header menu, and of the "
"[eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button] shortcode. Leave empty to use \"Withdraw "
"from contract\" in each visitor's language. The Directive asks for wording "
"such as \"withdraw from contract here\" or an equally unambiguous phrase."
msgstr ""
"Atsisakymo mygtuko tekstas poraštėje ir antraštės meniu bei trumpajame kode "
"[eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button]. Palikite tuščią, kad būtų naudojama "
"„Atsisakyti sutarties“ kiekvieno lankytojo kalba. Direktyvoje reikalaujama "
"formuluotės, pavyzdžiui, „atsisakyti sutarties čia“, arba kitos tokios pat "
"nedviprasmiškos frazės."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:87
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Header menu"
msgstr "Antraštės meniu"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Added to the main header menu (desktop and mobile). While off, the "
"withdrawal page is also kept out of the automatic page list some themes show "
"when no menu has been set up."
msgstr ""
"Pridedama prie pagrindinio antraštės meniu (kompiuteryje ir mobiliajame "
"įrenginyje). Kai išjungta, atsisakymo puslapis taip pat neįtraukiamas į "
"automatinį puslapių sąrašą, kurį kai kurios temos rodo, kai meniu "
"nenustatytas."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Show a \"Withdraw from contract\" link in the site's header menu."
msgstr "Rodyti nuorodą „Atsisakyti sutarties“ svetainės antraštės meniu."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:96
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Guest validation"
msgstr "Svečių tikrinimas"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose how to validate guest withdrawal requests. Spam protection via a "
"built-in honeypot field and IP limits apply."
msgstr ""
"Pasirinkite, kaip tikrinti svečių prašymus atsisakyti sutarties. Taikoma "
"apsauga nuo šlamšto naudojant integruotą „honeypot“ lauką ir IP apribojimus."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please note: As to current legal interpretation a validation lock would mean "
"that a consumer who makes a typo might no longer be able to submit their "
"withdrawal within the prescribed time limit—which directly contradicts the "
"protective purpose of Section 356a of the German Civil Code (BGB). Please "
"seek legal advise before using."
msgstr ""
"Atkreipkite dėmesį: pagal dabartinį teisinį aiškinimą tikrinimo blokavimas "
"reikštų, kad vartotojas, padaręs rašybos klaidą, galbūt nebegalėtų pateikti "
"atsisakymo per nustatytą terminą — tai tiesiogiai prieštarauja Vokietijos "
"civilinio kodekso (BGB) 356a skirsnio apsauginiam tikslui. Prieš naudodami "
"pasikonsultuokite su teisininku."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:103
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Enforce that the order number entered exists."
msgstr "Reikalauti, kad įvestas užsakymo numeris egzistuotų."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:104
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Order must exist and email must match the one from the original order."
msgstr ""
"Užsakymas turi egzistuoti, o el. pašto adresas turi sutapti su nurodytu "
"pradiniame užsakyme."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:105
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Either order number or email address must exist."
msgstr "Turi egzistuoti užsakymo numeris arba el. pašto adresas."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:106
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not validate"
msgstr "Netikrinti"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:111
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Partial withdrawals"
msgstr "Daliniai atsisakymai"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:112
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Allow customers and verified guests to select which order items to withdraw."
msgstr ""
"Leisti klientams ir patvirtintiems svečiams pasirinkti, kurių užsakymo "
"prekių atsisakyti."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:120
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Mandatory fields"
msgstr "Privalomi laukai"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:122
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Select fields that should be mandatory while submitting a new withdrawal"
msgstr ""
"Pasirinkite laukus, kurie turėtų būti privalomi pateikiant naują atsisakymą"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:142
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Allow guests to enter additional information in a separate text field."
msgstr "Leisti svečiams įvesti papildomą informaciją atskirame teksto lauke."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:150
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Non-refundable"
msgstr "Negrąžinama"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:151
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Choose certain product types to exclude from being withdrawn."
msgstr "Pasirinkite produktų tipus, kurių atsisakyti negalima."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:162
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal period"
msgstr "Atsisakymo terminas"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:163
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose the number of days, starting with the orders' completed date, to "
"accept withdrawals for orders."
msgstr ""
"Pasirinkite dienų skaičių nuo užsakymo įvykdymo datos, per kurį priimami "
"užsakymų atsisakymai."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Dienos"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the withdrawal period does not begin until the customer "
"receives the order. If necessary add a buffer period depending on your "
"shipping process. Use 0 to make withdrawals available at any time."
msgstr ""
"Atminkite, kad atsisakymo terminas neprasideda, kol klientas negauna "
"užsakymo. Jei reikia, pridėkite papildomą laikotarpį, atsižvelgdami į savo "
"siuntimo procesą. Įveskite 0, kad atsisakyti būtų galima bet kada."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:174
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Unverified requests"
msgstr "Nepatvirtinti prašymai"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not adjust order status for unverified requests."
msgstr "Nekeisti užsakymo būsenos dėl nepatvirtintų prašymų."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"For some requests, the email address differs from the original stored within "
"the order. Make sure these requests do not automatically set the pending "
"withdrawal order status."
msgstr ""
"Kai kurių prašymų el. pašto adresas skiriasi nuo išsaugoto pradiniame "
"užsakyme. Užtikrinkite, kad šie prašymai automatiškai nenustatytų užsakymo "
"būsenos „Laukiama atsisakymo“."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:183
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Contact email"
msgstr "Kontaktinis el. paštas"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:184
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please provide an email address where customers can contact you if they have "
"any issues."
msgstr ""
"Nurodykite el. pašto adresą, kuriuo klientai gali su jumis susisiekti, jei "
"kiltų problemų."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:194
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "My account page"
msgstr "Mano paskyros puslapis"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"On the my account page, add a link to create a new withdrawal request for "
"the order in case available."
msgstr ""
"Mano paskyros puslapyje, jei įmanoma, pridėti nuorodą naujam prašymui "
"atsisakyti užsakymo sukurti."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Shown as a \"Withdraw\" button next to \"View\" in My account → Orders, and "
"under \"Actions\" when the customer opens an order. It only appears for "
"orders that can still be withdrawn: processing or completed, within the "
"withdrawal period, with items left to withdraw, and once the withdrawal page "
"is published."
msgstr ""
"Rodoma kaip mygtukas „Atsisakyti“ šalia „Peržiūrėti“ skiltyje Mano paskyra → "
"Užsakymai ir skiltyje „Veiksmai“, kai klientas atidaro užsakymą. Rodoma tik "
"užsakymams, kurių dar galima atsisakyti: apdorojamiems arba įvykdytiems, per "
"atsisakymo terminą, su prekėmis, kurių dar galima atsisakyti, ir tik "
"paskelbus atsisakymo puslapį."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:215
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Virtual Product"
msgstr "Virtualus produktas"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:216
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Downloadable Product"
msgstr "Atsisiunčiamas produktas"

